{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_171", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye\n\nA) Sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye\nB) Geeli jagah par rakhna chahiye", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000034_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_171", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye\n\nA) Sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye\nB) Geeli jagah par rakhna chahiye"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye, humein uski gunvatta aur swabhav ko samajhna hoga. Gur ek mishrit padarth hai jo namee ke saath jaldee kharab ho sakta hai. Isliye, gur ko sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye taaki vah namee se door rahe aur lambe samay tak surakshit rahe. Geeli jagah par rakhne se gur kharab ho sakta hai aur uski gunvatta kharaab ho sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye, humein uski gunvatta aur swabhav ko samajhna hoga. Gur ek mishrit padarth hai jo namee ke saath jaldee kharab ho sakta hai. Isliye, gur ko sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye taaki vah namee se door rahe aur lambe samay tak surakshit rahe. Geeli jagah par rakhne se gur kharab ho sakta hai aur uski gunvatta kharaab ho sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye, humein uski gunvatta aur swabhav ko samajhna hoga. Gur ek mishrit padarth hai jo namee ke saath jaldee kharab ho sakta hai. Isliye, gur ko sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye taaki vah namee se door rahe aur lambe samay tak surakshit rahe. Geeli jagah par rakhne se gur kharab ho sakta hai aur uski gunvatta kharaab ho sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye, humein uski gunvatta aur swabhav ko samajhna hoga. Gur ek mishrit padarth hai jo namee ke saath jaldee kharab ho sakta hai. Isliye, gur ko sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye taaki vah namee se door rahe aur lambe samay tak surakshit rahe. Geeli jagah par rakhne se gur kharab ho sakta hai aur uski gunvatta kharaab ho sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Gur ko lambe samay tak surakshit rakhne ke liye, humein uski gunvatta aur swabhav ko samajhna hoga. Gur ek mishrit padarth hai jo namee ke saath jaldee kharab ho sakta hai. Isliye, gur ko sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye taaki vah namee se door rahe aur lambe samay tak surakshit rahe. Geeli jagah par rakhne se gur kharab ho sakta hai aur uski gunvatta kharaab ho sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
