{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_38", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode?\n\nA) Kam tel sokhenge aur kurkure honge.\nB) Zyaada tel sokhenge aur naram honge.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000062_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_38", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode?\n\nA) Kam tel sokhenge aur kurkure honge.\nB) Zyaada tel sokhenge aur naram honge."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode zyaada tel sokhenge kyunki tel ki taapmaan kam hone se pakode tel mein dheere se talte hain aur isse zyaada tel sookh jaata hai. Isse pakode naram bhi honge kyunki unhein talne mein zyaada samay lagta hai aur ve andar se achhi tarah se pak nahi pate. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode zyaada tel sokhenge kyunki tel ki taapmaan kam hone se pakode tel mein dheere se talte hain aur isse zyaada tel sookh jaata hai. Isse pakode naram bhi honge kyunki unhein talne mein zyaada samay lagta hai aur ve andar se achhi tarah se pak nahi pate. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode zyaada tel sokhenge kyunki tel ki taapmaan kam hone se pakode tel mein dheere se talte hain aur isse zyaada tel sookh jaata hai. Isse pakode naram bhi honge kyunki unhein talne mein zyaada samay lagta hai aur ve andar se achhi tarah se pak nahi pate. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode zyaada tel sokhenge kyunki tel ki taapmaan kam hone se pakode tel mein dheere se talte hain aur isse zyaada tel sookh jaata hai. Isse pakode naram bhi honge kyunki unhein talne mein zyaada samay lagta hai aur ve andar se achhi tarah se pak nahi pate. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Kadahi mein tel bahut thanda ho toh pakode zyaada tel sokhenge kyunki tel ki taapmaan kam hone se pakode tel mein dheere se talte hain aur isse zyaada tel sookh jaata hai. Isse pakode naram bhi honge kyunki unhein talne mein zyaada samay lagta hai aur ve andar se achhi tarah se pak nahi pate. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_156", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Kathan: Is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai. Yadi kathan mein di gayi sabhi baatein satya maani jaayein toh sahi karyawahi is prakaar hogi:\n\nA) Karyawahi I: Sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye.\nB) Karyawahi II: Ina sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ka samavesh karne hetu sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000001_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_156", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kathan: Is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai. Yadi kathan mein di gayi sabhi baatein satya maani jaayein toh sahi karyawahi is prakaar hogi:\n\nA) Karyawahi I: Sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye.\nB) Karyawahi II: Ina sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ka samavesh karne hetu sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska arth hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye, jisse in saphal vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sake. Yeh karyawahi I sahi karyawahi hogi, kyunki yeh vidyarthiyon ki badhti mang ko pura karne mein madad karegi.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "gold_fallback", "raw": "Varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska arth hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye, jisse in saphal vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sake. Yeh karyawahi I sahi karyawahi hogi, kyunki yeh vidyarthiyon ki badhti mang ko pura karne mein madad karegi.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska arth hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye, jisse in saphal vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sake. Yeh karyawahi I sahi karyawahi hogi, kyunki yeh vidyarthiyon ki badhti mang ko pura karne mein madad karegi.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyaar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna ek samadhaan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samasya ka poorna samadhan nahin ho sakta, kyunki yah keval vidyamaan colleges tak seemit rahega. \n\nKaryawahi II, jismein naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana shamil hai, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai, kyunki isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha ke avsar pradaan kiye ja sakte hain. Isliye, sahi karyawahi Karyawahi II hogi.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyaar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna ek samadhaan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samasya ka poorna samadhan nahin ho sakta, kyunki yah keval vidyamaan colleges tak seemit rahega. \n\nKaryawahi II, jismein naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana shamil hai, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai, kyunki isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha ke avsar pradaan kiye ja sakte hain. Isliye, sahi karyawahi Karyawahi II hogi.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 2, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna ek samadhan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samadhan seemit ho sakta hai kyunki yah vidyamaan sansthaanon ki kshamata par nirbhar karta hai. \n\nKaryawahi II, jisme naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaya jata hai, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai kyunki yah na keval adhik seats pradaan karta hai, balki naye avasar bhi pradaan karta hai. Isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sakta hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi is prakaar hogi ki sarkar ko ina sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ka samavesh karne hetu naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna ek samadhan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samadhan seemit ho sakta hai kyunki yah vidyamaan sansthaanon ki kshamata par nirbhar karta hai. \n\nKaryawahi II, jisme naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaya jata hai, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai kyunki yah na keval adhik seats pradaan karta hai, balki naye avasar bhi pradaan karta hai. Isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sakta hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi is prakaar hogi ki sarkar ko ina sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ka samavesh karne hetu naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 3, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska matlab yeh hai ki adhik vidyarthi agle star ki shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko ucch shiksha pradaan karne ke liye uplabdhiyan badhaani chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki baat kahi gayi hai, lekin yeh samasya ka samadhan nahin hai kyunki yeh sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko samaveshit nahin kar sakti. \n\nKaryawahi II mein naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaane ki baat kahi gayi hai, jo ki sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko samaveshit karne ka ek prabhavi tareeka ho sakta hai. Isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko ucch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar milega.\n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi B) Karyawahi II hogi, jismein sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska matlab yeh hai ki adhik vidyarthi agle star ki shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko ucch shiksha pradaan karne ke liye uplabdhiyan badhaani chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki baat kahi gayi hai, lekin yeh samasya ka samadhan nahin hai kyunki yeh sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko samaveshit nahin kar sakti. \n\nKaryawahi II mein naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaane ki baat kahi gayi hai, jo ki sabhi saphal vidyarthiyon ko samaveshit karne ka ek prabhavi tareeka ho sakta hai. Isse adhik vidyarthiyon ko ucch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar milega.\n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi B) Karyawahi II hogi, jismein sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 4, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I, jisme vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna shamil hai, ek samadhan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samasya ka poora samadhan nahin ho sakta, kyonki yah seats ki sankhya mein seemit vriddhi kar sakta hai. \n\nKaryawahi II, jisme sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai, kyonki yah adhik vidyarthiyon ko shiksha pradaan karne ke liye naye avsar pradaan kar sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi Karyawahi II hogi, jisme sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Yadi is varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, toh yah sanket karta hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko in vidyarthiyon ke liye paryapt avsar pradaan karne ke liye karyawahi karni chahiye. \n\nKaryawahi I, jisme vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karna shamil hai, ek samadhan ho sakta hai, lekin yah samasya ka poora samadhan nahin ho sakta, kyonki yah seats ki sankhya mein seemit vriddhi kar sakta hai. \n\nKaryawahi II, jisme sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye, adhik prabhavi ho sakta hai, kyonki yah adhik vidyarthiyon ko shiksha pradaan karne ke liye naye avsar pradaan kar sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi karyawahi Karyawahi II hogi, jisme sarkar ko naye college kholne ka sakriya kadam uthaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "swiss-ai/Apertus-70B-Instruct-2509", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Kathan mein di gayi sabhi baatein satya maani jaayein toh sahi karyawahi II hogi. Kyonki vriddhi abhootpoorva hai, isliye naye college kholne ki zaroorat hai, intermediate courses ki seats badhaane se kaam nahi chalega. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Kathan mein di gayi sabhi baatein satya maani jaayein toh sahi karyawahi II hogi. Kyonki vriddhi abhootpoorva hai, isliye naye college kholne ki zaroorat hai, intermediate courses ki seats badhaane se kaam nahi chalega. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "gold_fallback", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska arth hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye, jisse in saphal vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sake. Yeh karyawahi I sahi karyawahi hogi, kyunki yeh vidyarthiyon ki badhti mang ko pura karne mein madad karegi.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Varsh ki vidyalaya parityaag praman-patra pariksha mein saphal vidyarthiyon ki sankhya mein abhootpoorva vriddhi hui hai, iska arth hai ki adhik vidyarthi uchch shiksha ke liye aage badhne ke liye taiyar hain. Is sthiti mein, sarkar ko vidyamaan colleges mein intermediate courses ki seats ki sankhya badhaane ki vyavastha karni chahiye, jisse in saphal vidyarthiyon ko uchch shiksha prapt karne ka avsar mil sake. Yeh karyawahi I sahi karyawahi hogi, kyunki yeh vidyarthiyon ki badhti mang ko pura karne mein madad karegi.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_176", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए जो मिश्रण तैयार किया जाता है, उसे:\n\nA) तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है\nB) तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है और उसके उपरान्त, ठंडा कर के, चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0058_ex000017_hin_deva_1_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_176", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए जो मिश्रण तैयार किया जाता है, उसे:\n\nA) तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है\nB) तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है और उसके उपरान्त, ठंडा कर के, चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए मिश्रण तैयार करने के बाद, इसे तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है। तलने के तुरंत बाद, जलेबी को चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है ताकि वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से सोख ले। अगर जलेबी को पहले ठंडा किया जाए, तो वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से नहीं सोख पाएगी। इसलिए, सही तरीका यह है कि जलेबी को तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाए और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाए।\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए मिश्रण तैयार करने के बाद, इसे तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है। तलने के तुरंत बाद, जलेबी को चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है ताकि वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से सोख ले। अगर जलेबी को पहले ठंडा किया जाए, तो वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से नहीं सोख पाएगी। इसलिए, सही तरीका यह है कि जलेबी को तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाए और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाए।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए मिश्रण तैयार करने के बाद, इसे तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है। तलने के तुरंत बाद, जलेबी को चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है ताकि वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से सोख ले। अगर जलेबी को पहले ठंडा किया जाए, तो वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से नहीं सोख पाएगी। इसलिए, सही तरीका यह है कि जलेबी को तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाए और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाए।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए मिश्रण तैयार करने के बाद, इसे तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है। तलने के तुरंत बाद, जलेबी को चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है ताकि वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से सोख ले। अगर जलेबी को पहले ठंडा किया जाए, तो वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से नहीं सोख पाएगी। इसलिए, सही तरीका यह है कि जलेबी को तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाए और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाए।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "जलेबी बनाने के लिए मिश्रण तैयार करने के बाद, इसे तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाता है। तलने के तुरंत बाद, जलेबी को चाशनी में डुबोया जाता है ताकि वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से सोख ले। अगर जलेबी को पहले ठंडा किया जाए, तो वह चाशनी को अच्छी तरह से नहीं सोख पाएगी। इसलिए, सही तरीका यह है कि जलेबी को तेल गरम होने के बाद कढ़ाई में गोलाकार में तला जाए और उसके उपरान्त चाशनी में डुबोया जाए।\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_135", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season kaise karein?\n\nA) Kadahi ko buri tarah dhokar sukha lein. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchein. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karein. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dein aur prakriya ko dohraayein. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi.\nB) Kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lein. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchein. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karein. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dein aur prakriya ko dohraayein. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000010_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_135", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season kaise karein?\n\nA) Kadahi ko buri tarah dhokar sukha lein. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchein. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karein. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dein aur prakriya ko dohraayein. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi.\nB) Kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lein. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchein. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karein. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dein aur prakriya ko dohraayein. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season karne ke liye, sabse pehle kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lena chahiye. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchana chahiye. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karna chahiye. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dena chahiye aur prakriya ko dohraana chahiye. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi. Dono vikalpon mein same prakriya batayi gayi hai, isliye dono sahi hain. Lekin vikalp A mein \"buri tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya gaya hai, jo thoda galat lagta hai. Iske bajay \"achhi tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya jana chahiye. Isliye, vikalp B thoda adhik sahi lagta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season karne ke liye, sabse pehle kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lena chahiye. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchana chahiye. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karna chahiye. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dena chahiye aur prakriya ko dohraana chahiye. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi. Dono vikalpon mein same prakriya batayi gayi hai, isliye dono sahi hain. Lekin vikalp A mein \"buri tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya gaya hai, jo thoda galat lagta hai. Iske bajay \"achhi tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya jana chahiye. Isliye, vikalp B thoda adhik sahi lagta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season karne ke liye, sabse pehle kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lena chahiye. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchana chahiye. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karna chahiye. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dena chahiye aur prakriya ko dohraana chahiye. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi. Dono vikalpon mein same prakriya batayi gayi hai, isliye dono sahi hain. Lekin vikalp A mein \"buri tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya gaya hai, jo thoda galat lagta hai. Iske bajay \"achhi tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya jana chahiye. Isliye, vikalp B thoda adhik sahi lagta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season karne ke liye, sabse pehle kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lena chahiye. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchana chahiye. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karna chahiye. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dena chahiye aur prakriya ko dohraana chahiye. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi. Dono vikalpon mein same prakriya batayi gayi hai, isliye dono sahi hain. Lekin vikalp A mein \"buri tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya gaya hai, jo thoda galat lagta hai. Iske bajay \"achhi tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya jana chahiye. Isliye, vikalp B thoda adhik sahi lagta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Rasoi mein lohe ki kadahi ko achhi tarah se season karne ke liye, sabse pehle kadahi ko achhi tarah dhokar sukha lena chahiye. Phir halka sa tel daalkar kadahi ki satah par ponchana chahiye. Dheemi aanch par 10-15 minute garam karna chahiye. Thanda hone ke baad atirikt tel nikaal dena chahiye aur prakriya ko dohraana chahiye. Niyamit upyog se kadahi ki satah chikni aur non-stick ban jaayegi. Dono vikalpon mein same prakriya batayi gayi hai, isliye dono sahi hain. Lekin vikalp A mein \"buri tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya gaya hai, jo thoda galat lagta hai. Iske bajay \"achhi tarah dhokar\" shabd ka upyog kiya jana chahiye. Isliye, vikalp B thoda adhik sahi lagta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_78", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye\n\nA) Aapko ise dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\nB) Aapko usmein bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarni chahiye.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000099_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_78", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye\n\nA) Aapko ise dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\nB) Aapko usmein bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarni chahiye."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye, humein iska sahi tareeka jaanna hoga. Dholak ko bajaane ke liye, hum iske dono siron par haathon se maarte hain. Isse dhvani utpann hoti hai aur yeh tez bhi ho sakti hai agar hum jor se maarte hain. Bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarna dholak ke liye uchit nahin hai, kyunki dholak ek percussion instrument hai, jise maarkar bajaaya jaata hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki aapko dholak ko dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye, humein iska sahi tareeka jaanna hoga. Dholak ko bajaane ke liye, hum iske dono siron par haathon se maarte hain. Isse dhvani utpann hoti hai aur yeh tez bhi ho sakti hai agar hum jor se maarte hain. Bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarna dholak ke liye uchit nahin hai, kyunki dholak ek percussion instrument hai, jise maarkar bajaaya jaata hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki aapko dholak ko dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye, humein iska sahi tareeka jaanna hoga. Dholak ko bajaane ke liye, hum iske dono siron par haathon se maarte hain. Isse dhvani utpann hoti hai aur yeh tez bhi ho sakti hai agar hum jor se maarte hain. Bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarna dholak ke liye uchit nahin hai, kyunki dholak ek percussion instrument hai, jise maarkar bajaaya jaata hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki aapko dholak ko dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye, humein iska sahi tareeka jaanna hoga. Dholak ko bajaane ke liye, hum iske dono siron par haathon se maarte hain. Isse dhvani utpann hoti hai aur yeh tez bhi ho sakti hai agar hum jor se maarte hain. Bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarna dholak ke liye uchit nahin hai, kyunki dholak ek percussion instrument hai, jise maarkar bajaaya jaata hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki aapko dholak ko dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Dholak se tez dhvani nikaalne ke liye, humein iska sahi tareeka jaanna hoga. Dholak ko bajaane ke liye, hum iske dono siron par haathon se maarte hain. Isse dhvani utpann hoti hai aur yeh tez bhi ho sakti hai agar hum jor se maarte hain. Bansuri ki tarah phoonk maarna dholak ke liye uchit nahin hai, kyunki dholak ek percussion instrument hai, jise maarkar bajaaya jaata hai.\n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki aapko dholak ko dono siron se haathon se bajaana chahiye.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_115", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se kya phaayada hai?\n\nA) Safed rang zyaada garmi sokhega toh sar thanda rahega.\nB) Safed rang kam garmi sokhega toh sar thanda rahega.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000083_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_115", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se kya phaayada hai?\n\nA) Safed rang zyaada garmi sokhega toh sar thanda rahega.\nB) Safed rang kam garmi sokhega toh sar thanda rahega."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rehne mein madad milti hai. Safed rang surya ki garmi ko kam sokhta hai, jisse sar par garmi ka prabhav kam hota hai. Isliye, safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rehne mein madad milti hai. Safed rang surya ki garmi ko kam sokhta hai, jisse sar par garmi ka prabhav kam hota hai. Isliye, safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rehne mein madad milti hai. Safed rang surya ki garmi ko kam sokhta hai, jisse sar par garmi ka prabhav kam hota hai. Isliye, safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rehne mein madad milti hai. Safed rang surya ki garmi ko kam sokhta hai, jisse sar par garmi ka prabhav kam hota hai. Isliye, safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Dhoop mein safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rehne mein madad milti hai. Safed rang surya ki garmi ko kam sokhta hai, jisse sar par garmi ka prabhav kam hota hai. Isliye, safed pagri pehnaane se sar thanda rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_19", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "एक पारंपरिक पूजा के दौरान, आप चाहते हैं कि समारोह के दौरान देवता को अर्पित किए गए फूल ताजे रहें। आपको क्या करना चाहिए?\n\nA) पूजा से पहले फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ दें।\nB) पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखें।", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0083_ex000041_hin_deva_5_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_19", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "एक पारंपरिक पूजा के दौरान, आप चाहते हैं कि समारोह के दौरान देवता को अर्पित किए गए फूल ताजे रहें। आपको क्या करना चाहिए?\n\nA) पूजा से पहले फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ दें।\nB) पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखें।"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "फूलों को ताज़ा रखने के लिए, उन्हें हवा से दूर रखना चाहिए, क्योंकि हवा में मौजूद ऑक्सीजन फूलों को जल्दी मुरझाने का कारण बन सकती है। इसके अलावा, फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ने से वे सूख सकते हैं और मुरझा सकते हैं। इसलिए, पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखना उचित होगा।\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "फूलों को ताज़ा रखने के लिए, उन्हें हवा से दूर रखना चाहिए, क्योंकि हवा में मौजूद ऑक्सीजन फूलों को जल्दी मुरझाने का कारण बन सकती है। इसके अलावा, फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ने से वे सूख सकते हैं और मुरझा सकते हैं। इसलिए, पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखना उचित होगा।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "फूलों को ताज़ा रखने के लिए, उन्हें हवा से दूर रखना चाहिए, क्योंकि हवा में मौजूद ऑक्सीजन फूलों को जल्दी मुरझाने का कारण बन सकती है। इसके अलावा, फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ने से वे सूख सकते हैं और मुरझा सकते हैं। इसलिए, पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखना उचित होगा।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "फूलों को ताज़ा रखने के लिए, उन्हें हवा से दूर रखना चाहिए, क्योंकि हवा में मौजूद ऑक्सीजन फूलों को जल्दी मुरझाने का कारण बन सकती है। इसके अलावा, फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ने से वे सूख सकते हैं और मुरझा सकते हैं। इसलिए, पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखना उचित होगा।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "फूलों को ताज़ा रखने के लिए, उन्हें हवा से दूर रखना चाहिए, क्योंकि हवा में मौजूद ऑक्सीजन फूलों को जल्दी मुरझाने का कारण बन सकती है। इसके अलावा, फूलों को खुली हवा में लंबे समय तक छोड़ने से वे सूख सकते हैं और मुरझा सकते हैं। इसलिए, पूजा तक फूलों को हवा से दूर रखना उचित होगा।\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_14", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Bharat ka rajya pushp kamal hai, kamal hamesha:\n\nA) Keechad mein khilta hai\nB) Kisi bhi prakaar ke paani mein khilta hai", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000037_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_14", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Bharat ka rajya pushp kamal hai, kamal hamesha:\n\nA) Keechad mein khilta hai\nB) Kisi bhi prakaar ke paani mein khilta hai"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kamal ke baare mein jaankari hai ki yeh paani mein khilne wala phool hai, lekin yeh keechad mein bhi ugta hai. Kamal ke paudhe ke liye keechad ya gadda zameen zaroori hoti hai, jahan se yeh apna bhoomigat taney bana sakta hai. Isliye, kamal hamesha keechad mein khilta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Kamal ke baare mein jaankari hai ki yeh paani mein khilne wala phool hai, lekin yeh keechad mein bhi ugta hai. Kamal ke paudhe ke liye keechad ya gadda zameen zaroori hoti hai, jahan se yeh apna bhoomigat taney bana sakta hai. Isliye, kamal hamesha keechad mein khilta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Kamal ke baare mein jaankari hai ki yeh paani mein khilne wala phool hai, lekin yeh keechad mein bhi ugta hai. Kamal ke paudhe ke liye keechad ya gadda zameen zaroori hoti hai, jahan se yeh apna bhoomigat taney bana sakta hai. Isliye, kamal hamesha keechad mein khilta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Kamal ke baare mein jaankari hai ki yeh paani mein khilne wala phool hai, lekin yeh keechad mein bhi ugta hai. Kamal ke paudhe ke liye keechad ya gadda zameen zaroori hoti hai, jahan se yeh apna bhoomigat taney bana sakta hai. Isliye, kamal hamesha keechad mein khilta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Kamal ke baare mein jaankari hai ki yeh paani mein khilne wala phool hai, lekin yeh keechad mein bhi ugta hai. Kamal ke paudhe ke liye keechad ya gadda zameen zaroori hoti hai, jahan se yeh apna bhoomigat taney bana sakta hai. Isliye, kamal hamesha keechad mein khilta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_177", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "पंजाब का भांगड़ा नृत्य आमतौर पर इस प्रकार किया जाता है:\n\nA) फसल और त्योहारों का उत्साहपूर्वक जश्न मनाने के लिए\nB) राजपरिवारों के विवाह समारोहों में", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0058_ex000131_hin_deva_1_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_177", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "पंजाब का भांगड़ा नृत्य आमतौर पर इस प्रकार किया जाता है:\n\nA) फसल और त्योहारों का उत्साहपूर्वक जश्न मनाने के लिए\nB) राजपरिवारों के विवाह समारोहों में"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "भांगड़ा नृत्य पंजाब की एक पारंपरिक लोक नृत्य शैली है, जो आमतौर पर फसल की कटाई और त्योहारों के दौरान किया जाता है। यह नृत्य खुशी और उत्साह की अभिव्यक्ति के रूप में किया जाता है, जो फसल की अच्छी पैदावार और समृद्धि के लिए कृतज्ञता व्यक्त करता है। इसलिए, यह नृत्य फसल और त्योहारों का उत्साहपूर्वक जश्न मनाने के लिए किया जाता है।\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "भांगड़ा नृत्य पंजाब की एक पारंपरिक लोक नृत्य शैली है, जो आमतौर पर फसल की कटाई और त्योहारों के दौरान किया जाता है। यह नृत्य खुशी और उत्साह की अभिव्यक्ति के रूप में किया जाता है, जो फसल की अच्छी पैदावार और समृद्धि के लिए कृतज्ञता व्यक्त करता है। इसलिए, यह नृत्य फसल और त्योहारों का उत्साहपूर्वक जश्न मनाने के लिए किया जाता है।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "भांगड़ा नृत्य पंजाब की एक पारंपरिक लोक नृत्य शैली है, जो आमतौर पर फसल की कटाई और त्योहारों के दौरान किया जाता है। यह नृत्य खुशी और उत्साह की अभिव्यक्ति के रूप में किया जाता है, जो फसल की अच्छी पैदावार और समृद्धि के लिए कृतज्ञता व्यक्त करता है। इसलिए, यह नृत्य फसल और त्योहारों का उत्साहपूर्वक जश्न मनाने के लिए किया जाता है।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "