{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_85", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karein.\nB) Puja se pehle niyamit roop se dhoye jaane waale bartanon ka upyog karein.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000076_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_85", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karein.\nB) Puja se pehle niyamit roop se dhoye jaane waale bartanon ka upyog karein."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahna zaroori hai. Isliye, vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karna uchit hoga. Yeh sunishchit karega ki puja ke dauraan upyog kiye jaane wale bartan aur paani avashyak roop se saaf aur pavitra rahein. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahna zaroori hai. Isliye, vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karna uchit hoga. Yeh sunishchit karega ki puja ke dauraan upyog kiye jaane wale bartan aur paani avashyak roop se saaf aur pavitra rahein. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahna zaroori hai. Isliye, vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karna uchit hoga. Yeh sunishchit karega ki puja ke dauraan upyog kiye jaane wale bartan aur paani avashyak roop se saaf aur pavitra rahein. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahna zaroori hai. Isliye, vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karna uchit hoga. Yeh sunishchit karega ki puja ke dauraan upyog kiye jaane wale bartan aur paani avashyak roop se saaf aur pavitra rahein. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Karva Chauth ke dauraan, puja ke liye upyog kiya jaane wala paani aur bartan saaf aur bina dooshit rahna zaroori hai. Isliye, vishesh roop se puja ke liye bartanon ke ek alag, saaf set ka upyog karna uchit hoga. Yeh sunishchit karega ki puja ke dauraan upyog kiye jaane wale bartan aur paani avashyak roop se saaf aur pavitra rahein. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_118", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "चाय बनानी है।\n\nA) दूध उबालें। फिर उसमें नमक और मिर्च डालें।\nB) पानी उबालें। चायपत्ती और चीनी डालें। दूध डालकर उबालें।", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0097_ex000059_hin_deva_8_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_118", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "चाय बनानी है।\n\nA) दूध उबालें। फिर उसमें नमक और मिर्च डालें।\nB) पानी उबालें। चायपत्ती और चीनी डालें। दूध डालकर उबालें।"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "चाय बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले पानी को उबालना होता है, फिर उसमें चायपत्ती और चीनी डालकर उबालना होता है। इसके बाद दूध डालकर उबालें ताकि चाय अच्छी तरह से बन जाए। इसलिए, चाय बनाने की सही विधि में पानी को उबालना, चायपत्ती और चीनी डालना, और फिर दूध डालना शामिल है।\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "चाय बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले पानी को उबालना होता है, फिर उसमें चायपत्ती और चीनी डालकर उबालना होता है। इसके बाद दूध डालकर उबालें ताकि चाय अच्छी तरह से बन जाए। इसलिए, चाय बनाने की सही विधि में पानी को उबालना, चायपत्ती और चीनी डालना, और फिर दूध डालना शामिल है।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "चाय बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले पानी को उबालना होता है, फिर उसमें चायपत्ती और चीनी डालकर उबालना होता है। इसके बाद दूध डालकर उबालें ताकि चाय अच्छी तरह से बन जाए। इसलिए, चाय बनाने की सही विधि में पानी को उबालना, चायपत्ती और चीनी डालना, और फिर दूध डालना शामिल है।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "चाय बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले पानी को उबालना होता है, फिर उसमें चायपत्ती और चीनी डालकर उबालना होता है। इसके बाद दूध डालकर उबालें ताकि चाय अच्छी तरह से बन जाए। इसलिए, चाय बनाने की सही विधि में पानी को उबालना, चायपत्ती और चीनी डालना, और फिर दूध डालना शामिल है।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "चाय बनाने के लिए सबसे पहले पानी को उबालना होता है, फिर उसमें चायपत्ती और चीनी डालकर उबालना होता है। इसके बाद दूध डालकर उबालें ताकि चाय अच्छी तरह से बन जाए। इसलिए, चाय बनाने की सही विधि में पानी को उबालना, चायपत्ती और चीनी डालना, और फिर दूध डालना शामिल है।\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_109", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein\n\nA) Pakka khaaya jaata hai.\nB) Kachcha khaaya jaata hai.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000078_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_109", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein\n\nA) Pakka khaaya jaata hai.\nB) Kachcha khaaya jaata hai."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakane ke baad hi khaya jaata hai, kyunki ve iske baad hi swadisht aur pachne yogya hote hain. Inhein kachcha khane se unka teekha swaad aur kathorata badh jaati hai, jo khane ke anubhav ko prabhavit kar sakta hai. Isliye, lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakka khaya jaata hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakane ke baad hi khaya jaata hai, kyunki ve iske baad hi swadisht aur pachne yogya hote hain. Inhein kachcha khane se unka teekha swaad aur kathorata badh jaati hai, jo khane ke anubhav ko prabhavit kar sakta hai. Isliye, lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakka khaya jaata hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakane ke baad hi khaya jaata hai, kyunki ve iske baad hi swadisht aur pachne yogya hote hain. Inhein kachcha khane se unka teekha swaad aur kathorata badh jaati hai, jo khane ke anubhav ko prabhavit kar sakta hai. Isliye, lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakka khaya jaata hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakane ke baad hi khaya jaata hai, kyunki ve iske baad hi swadisht aur pachne yogya hote hain. Inhein kachcha khane se unka teekha swaad aur kathorata badh jaati hai, jo khane ke anubhav ko prabhavit kar sakta hai. Isliye, lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakka khaya jaata hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakane ke baad hi khaya jaata hai, kyunki ve iske baad hi swadisht aur pachne yogya hote hain. Inhein kachcha khane se unka teekha swaad aur kathorata badh jaati hai, jo khane ke anubhav ko prabhavit kar sakta hai. Isliye, lahasun aur adrak ko sabzi mein pakka khaya jaata hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_133", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par?\n\nA) Aur mazboot--tantu kade.\nB) Kamzor pad sakti--tantu dheele.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000036_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_133", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par?\n\nA) Aur mazboot--tantu kade.\nB) Kamzor pad sakti--tantu dheele."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par uske tantu dheele pad sakte hain, jisse rassi ki mazbooti kam ho sakti hai. Isliye, jute ki rassi geeli hone par kamzor pad sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par uske tantu dheele pad sakte hain, jisse rassi ki mazbooti kam ho sakti hai. Isliye, jute ki rassi geeli hone par kamzor pad sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par uske tantu dheele pad sakte hain, jisse rassi ki mazbooti kam ho sakti hai. Isliye, jute ki rassi geeli hone par kamzor pad sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par uske tantu dheele pad sakte hain, jisse rassi ki mazbooti kam ho sakti hai. Isliye, jute ki rassi geeli hone par kamzor pad sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Jute ki rassi geeli hone par uske tantu dheele pad sakte hain, jisse rassi ki mazbooti kam ho sakti hai. Isliye, jute ki rassi geeli hone par kamzor pad sakti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_142", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Lassi mathne se makkhan\n\nA) Neeche jaata hai\nB) Oopar aata hai", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000038_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_142", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Lassi mathne se makkhan\n\nA) Neeche jaata hai\nB) Oopar aata hai"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Lassi mathne par usmein makkhan alag hota hai aur oopar aata hai. Iska karan yeh hai ki makkhan ki ghanta lassi ke baaki hisse se adhik hoti hai, jiske karan vah oopar tairta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki lassi mathne se makkhan oopar aata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Lassi mathne par usmein makkhan alag hota hai aur oopar aata hai. Iska karan yeh hai ki makkhan ki ghanta lassi ke baaki hisse se adhik hoti hai, jiske karan vah oopar tairta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki lassi mathne se makkhan oopar aata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Lassi mathne par usmein makkhan alag hota hai aur oopar aata hai. Iska karan yeh hai ki makkhan ki ghanta lassi ke baaki hisse se adhik hoti hai, jiske karan vah oopar tairta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki lassi mathne se makkhan oopar aata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Lassi mathne par usmein makkhan alag hota hai aur oopar aata hai. Iska karan yeh hai ki makkhan ki ghanta lassi ke baaki hisse se adhik hoti hai, jiske karan vah oopar tairta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki lassi mathne se makkhan oopar aata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Lassi mathne par usmein makkhan alag hota hai aur oopar aata hai. Iska karan yeh hai ki makkhan ki ghanta lassi ke baaki hisse se adhik hoti hai, jiske karan vah oopar tairta hai. \n\nIsliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki lassi mathne se makkhan oopar aata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
