{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_123", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Peetal-patang ki maanjhe mein kaanch powder?\n\nA) Kaatne ke liye gharshan badhta hai.\nB) Narmi ke liye gharshan ghat-ta.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000000_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_123", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Peetal-patang ki maanjhe mein kaanch powder?\n\nA) Kaatne ke liye gharshan badhta hai.\nB) Narmi ke liye gharshan ghat-ta."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Peetal-patang ki maanjhe mein kaanch powder milaya jata hai, jisse uski kaatne ki kshamta badh jaati hai. Kaanch powder ke karan maanjhe mein gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse patang ko kaatne mein madad milti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki kaanch powder kaatne ke liye gharshan badhta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Peetal-patang ki maanjhe mein kaanch powder milaya jata hai, jisse uski kaatne ki kshamta badh jaati hai. Kaanch powder ke karan maanjhe mein gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse patang ko kaatne mein madad milti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki kaanch powder kaatne ke liye gharshan badhta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Peetal-patang ki maanjhe mein kaanch powder milaya jata hai, jisse uski kaatne ki kshamta badh jaati hai. Kaanch powder ke karan maanjhe mein gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse patang ko kaatne mein madad milti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki kaanch powder kaatne ke liye gharshan badhta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw