{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_100", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Basant Panchami manaane ke mukhya kaaran:\n\nA) Vasant ritu ka aagaman\nB) Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000011_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_100", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Basant Panchami manaane ke mukhya kaaran:\n\nA) Vasant ritu ka aagaman\nB) Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Basant Panchami ka tyohar vasant ritu ke aagaman ka prateek hai, lekin iske peeche ek aur mahatvapoorn kaaran bhi hai. Yah din Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas bhi mana jaata hai, jo gyaan, kala aur sangeet ki devi maani jaati hain. Is din log Maa Saraswati ki pooja karte hain aur unki kripa praapt karne ki kaamna karte hain. Isliye, Basant Panchami manaane ke mukhya kaaran Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Basant Panchami ka tyohar vasant ritu ke aagaman ka prateek hai, lekin iske peeche ek aur mahatvapoorn kaaran bhi hai. Yah din Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas bhi mana jaata hai, jo gyaan, kala aur sangeet ki devi maani jaati hain. Is din log Maa Saraswati ki pooja karte hain aur unki kripa praapt karne ki kaamna karte hain. Isliye, Basant Panchami manaane ke mukhya kaaran Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Basant Panchami ka tyohar vasant ritu ke aagaman ka prateek hai, lekin iske peeche ek aur mahatvapoorn kaaran bhi hai. Yah din Maa Saraswati ka janmadivas bhi mana jaata hai, jo gyaan, kala aur sangeet ki devi maani jaati hain. Is din log Maa Saraswati ki pooja karte hain aur unki kripa praapt karne 