{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_72", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar--kyon?\n\nA) Hawa bharne se.\nB) Crystallization pattern.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000054_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_72", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar--kyon?\n\nA) Hawa bharne se.\nB) Crystallization pattern."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar hota hai kyunki isme crystallization pattern ka kaam hota hai. Jab ghee thanda hota hai, to uske molecules ek dusre ke saath judkar crystals banate hain, jisse yeh daanedaar ban jata hai. Is prakriya mein, crystals oopar ki aur jamte hain, jisse ghee ki satah par daanedaar banavat banti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar hota hai kyunki isme crystallization pattern ka kaam hota hai. Jab ghee thanda hota hai, to uske molecules ek dusre ke saath judkar crystals banate hain, jisse yeh daanedaar ban jata hai. Is prakriya mein, crystals oopar ki aur jamte hain, jisse ghee ki satah par daanedaar banavat banti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar hota hai kyunki isme crystallization pattern ka kaam hota hai. Jab ghee thanda hota hai, to uske molecules ek dusre ke saath judkar crystals banate hain, jisse yeh daanedaar ban jata hai. Is prakriya mein, crystals oopar ki aur jamte hain, jisse ghee ki satah par daanedaar banavat banti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar hota hai kyunki isme crystallization pattern ka kaam hota hai. Jab ghee thanda hota hai, to uske molecules ek dusre ke saath judkar crystals banate hain, jisse yeh daanedaar ban jata hai. Is prakriya mein, crystals oopar ki aur jamte hain, jisse ghee ki satah par daanedaar banavat banti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Ghee jamne par oopar daanedaar hota hai kyunki isme crystallization pattern ka kaam hota hai. Jab ghee thanda hota hai, to uske molecules ek dusre ke saath judkar crystals banate hain, jisse yeh daanedaar ban jata hai. Is prakriya mein, crystals oopar ki aur jamte hain, jisse ghee ki satah par daanedaar banavat banti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_27", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne ka prabhav?\n\nA) Chikni satah behtar pakad banaati hai.\nB) Khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000072_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_27", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne ka prabhav?\n\nA) Chikni satah behtar pakad banaati hai.\nB) Khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne se uski satah khurdari ho jaati hai. Is khurdari satah ke kaaran gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse lahasun jaldi pees-ti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne se uski satah khurdari ho jaati hai. Is khurdari satah ke kaaran gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse lahasun jaldi pees-ti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne se uski satah khurdari ho jaati hai. Is khurdari satah ke kaaran gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse lahasun jaldi pees-ti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne se uski satah khurdari ho jaati hai. Is khurdari satah ke kaaran gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse lahasun jaldi pees-ti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Patthar ki sil-batte par lahasun kootne se uski satah khurdari ho jaati hai. Is khurdari satah ke kaaran gharshan badh jaata hai, jisse lahasun jaldi pees-ti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki khurdari satah gharshan badhaakar jaldi pees-ti hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_184", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakna kyon?\n\nA) Uccha taap par sharkara vaashpit.\nB) Uccha taap par sharkara caramelize.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000067_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_184", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakna kyon?\n\nA) Uccha taap par sharkara vaashpit.\nB) Uccha taap par sharkara caramelize."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakne ka karan uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hai. Jab doodh ko ucche taap par garam kiya jata hai, to sharkara apni rachna badal leti hai aur ek jatil carbohydrate mein parivaartit ho jaati hai, jisse yeh chipakne lagti hai. Is prakriya ko caramelize kehte hain. \n\nIsliye, uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hi doodh-cheeni ke jaldi chipakne ka mukhya karan hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakne ka karan uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hai. Jab doodh ko ucche taap par garam kiya jata hai, to sharkara apni rachna badal leti hai aur ek jatil carbohydrate mein parivaartit ho jaati hai, jisse yeh chipakne lagti hai. Is prakriya ko caramelize kehte hain. \n\nIsliye, uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hi doodh-cheeni ke jaldi chipakne ka mukhya karan hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakne ka karan uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hai. Jab doodh ko ucche taap par garam kiya jata hai, to sharkara apni rachna badal leti hai aur ek jatil carbohydrate mein parivaartit ho jaati hai, jisse yeh chipakne lagti hai. Is prakriya ko caramelize kehte hain. \n\nIsliye, uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hi doodh-cheeni ke jaldi chipakne ka mukhya karan hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakne ka karan uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hai. Jab doodh ko ucche taap par garam kiya jata hai, to sharkara apni rachna badal leti hai aur ek jatil carbohydrate mein parivaartit ho jaati hai, jisse yeh chipakne lagti hai. Is prakriya ko caramelize kehte hain. \n\nIsliye, uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hi doodh-cheeni ke jaldi chipakne ka mukhya karan hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Kadahi mein doodh-cheeni jaldi chipakne ka karan uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hai. Jab doodh ko ucche taap par garam kiya jata hai, to sharkara apni rachna badal leti hai aur ek jatil carbohydrate mein parivaartit ho jaati hai, jisse yeh chipakne lagti hai. Is prakriya ko caramelize kehte hain. \n\nIsliye, uccha taap par sharkara ka caramelize hona hi doodh-cheeni ke jaldi chipakne ka mukhya karan hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
