{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_198", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Pongal ke din aap safed chawal aur gur ke bajaya laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog kar rahe hain. Kya karenge?\n\nA) Saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\nB) Saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya maatam aur shok hai.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000085_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_198", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Pongal ke din aap safed chawal aur gur ke bajaya laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog kar rahe hain. Kya karenge?\n\nA) Saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\nB) Saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya maatam aur shok hai."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Pongal ek tyohar hai jo dhanyavaad aur khushi ka prateek hai. Ismein safed chawal aur gur ka upyog karke Pongal banaya jata hai, lekin yadi aap laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog karte hain to bhi iska uddeshya nahin badalta. Tyohar ka mool uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi vyakt karna hai, isliye saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banaya ja sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Pongal ek tyohar hai jo dhanyavaad aur khushi ka prateek hai. Ismein safed chawal aur gur ka upyog karke Pongal banaya jata hai, lekin yadi aap laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog karte hain to bhi iska uddeshya nahin badalta. Tyohar ka mool uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi vyakt karna hai, isliye saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banaya ja sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Pongal ek tyohar hai jo dhanyavaad aur khushi ka prateek hai. Ismein safed chawal aur gur ka upyog karke Pongal banaya jata hai, lekin yadi aap laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog karte hain to bhi iska uddeshya nahin badalta. Tyohar ka mool uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi vyakt karna hai, isliye saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banaya ja sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Pongal ek tyohar hai jo dhanyavaad aur khushi ka prateek hai. Ismein safed chawal aur gur ka upyog karke Pongal banaya jata hai, lekin yadi aap laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog karte hain to bhi iska uddeshya nahin badalta. Tyohar ka mool uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi vyakt karna hai, isliye saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banaya ja sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Pongal ek tyohar hai jo dhanyavaad aur khushi ka prateek hai. Ismein safed chawal aur gur ka upyog karke Pongal banaya jata hai, lekin yadi aap laal chawal aur shakkar ka upyog karte hain to bhi iska uddeshya nahin badalta. Tyohar ka mool uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi vyakt karna hai, isliye saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banaya ja sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, saamagri badalkar bhi Pongal banayenge kyonki tyohar ka uddeshya dhanyavaad aur khushi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
