{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_138", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Ghee garam karne par\n\nA) Taral ho jaata hai\nB) Thos ho jaata hai", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000084_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_138", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ghee garam karne par\n\nA) Taral ho jaata hai\nB) Thos ho jaata hai"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ghee ko garam karne par uska avastha parivartan hota hai. Ghee ek thos padarth hai jo kam taapmaan par jamta hai aur garam hone par pighalne lagta hai. Isliye, ghee ko garam karne par vah taral ho jaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Ghee ko garam karne par uska avastha parivartan hota hai. Ghee ek thos padarth hai jo kam taapmaan par jamta hai aur garam hone par pighalne lagta hai. Isliye, ghee ko garam karne par vah taral ho jaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Ghee ko garam karne par uska avastha parivartan hota hai. Ghee ek thos padarth hai jo kam taapmaan par jamta hai aur garam hone par pighalne lagta hai. Isliye, ghee ko garam karne par vah taral ho jaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Ghee ko garam karne par uska avastha parivartan hota hai. Ghee ek thos padarth hai jo kam taapmaan par jamta hai aur garam hone par pighalne lagta hai. Isliye, ghee ko garam karne par vah taral ho jaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghee ko garam karne par uska avastha parivartan hota hai. Ghee ek thos padarth hai jo kam taapmaan par jamta hai aur garam hone par pighalne lagta hai. Isliye, ghee ko garam karne par vah taral ho jaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
