{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_56", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki rakhi ke dhaage anchhue aur saaf-suthre rahein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Sunishchit karein ki rakhiyon ko jagah ke saath baandha gaya hai.\nB) Bahut si ladkiyon ko rakhi na baandhne dein.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000019_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_56", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki rakhi ke dhaage anchhue aur saaf-suthre rahein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Sunishchit karein ki rakhiyon ko jagah ke saath baandha gaya hai.\nB) Bahut si ladkiyon ko rakhi na baandhne dein."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, rakhi ke dhaage anchhue aur saaf-suthre rahne ke liye, humein yeh sunishchit karna chahiye ki rakhiyon ko jagah ke saath baandha gaya hai. Isse rakhi ke dhaage tootne ya gande hone ki sambhavana kam ho jati hai. Isliye, vikalp A sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, rakhi ke dhaage anchhue aur saaf-suthre rahne ke liye, humein yeh sunishchit karna chahiye ki rakhiyon ko jagah ke saath baandha gaya hai. Isse rakhi ke dhaage tootne ya gande hone ki sambhavana kam ho jati hai. Isliye, vikalp A sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, rakhi ke dhaage anchhue aur saaf-suthre rahne ke liye, humein yeh sunishchit karna chahiye ki rakhiyon ko jagah ke saath baandha gaya hai. Isse rakhi ke dhaage tootne ya gande hone ki sambhavana kam ho jati hai. Isliye, vikalp A sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "indepe