{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_191", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Kanche (goli) khelte samay nishana lagaane se\n\nA) Kancha doosre kanche se takraata hai\nB) Kancha gayab ho jaata hai", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000021_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_191", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kanche (goli) khelte samay nishana lagaane se\n\nA) Kancha doosre kanche se takraata hai\nB) Kancha gayab ho jaata hai"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kanche (goli) khelte samay nishana lagaane ka mukhya uddeshya ek kanche ko doosre kanche se takraana hai. Is prakriya mein, ek kanche ko nishana banakar use doosre kanche se takraaya jaata hai, jisse ve dono apni sthiti badalte hain. Isliye, nishana lagaane se kanche ka doosre kanche se takraana hi mukhya parinaam hota hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Kanche (goli) khelte samay nishana lagaane ka mukhya uddeshya ek kanche ko doosre kanche se takraana hai. Is prakriya mein, ek kanche ko nishana banakar use doosre kanche se takraaya jaata hai, jisse ve dono apni sthiti badalte hain. Isliye, nishana lagaane se kanche ka doosre kanche se takraana hi mukhya parinaam hota hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Kanche (goli) khelte samay nishana lagaane ka mukhya uddeshya ek kanche ko doosre kanche se takraana hai. Is prakriya mein, ek kanche ko nishana banakar use doosre kanche se takraaya jaata hai, jisse ve dono apni sthiti badalte hain. Isliye, nishana lagaane se kanche ka doosre kanche se takraana hi mukhya parinaam hota hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct"