{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_154", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' kyon bolta hai?\n\nA) Yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans lekar virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans chhod de toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai. Is prakriya se khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain.\nB) Yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai. Is prakriya se khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000077_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_154", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' kyon bolta hai?\n\nA) Yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans lekar virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans chhod de toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai. Is prakriya se khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain.\nB) Yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai. Is prakriya se khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' bolta hai kyonki yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai, jisse khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo is niyam ko sahi tarike se samjhata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' bolta hai kyonki yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai, jisse khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo is niyam ko sahi tarike se samjhata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' bolta hai kyonki yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai, jisse khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo is niyam ko sahi tarike se samjhata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' bolta hai kyonki yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai, jisse khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo is niyam ko sahi tarike se samjhata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Kabaddi khelte samay khiladi saans rokkara 'Kabaddi-Kabaddi' bolta hai kyonki yeh niyam khiladi ko lagataar saans rokkara virodhi team ko chhoone ke liye majboor karta hai. Yadi vah saans le leta hai toh usaki baari samaapt maani jaati hai, jisse khel mein romanch aur kathinaai dono badh jaate hain. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo is niyam ko sahi tarike se samjhata hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_129", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Ek paramparik puja ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bacein.\nB) Roshani karte samay unhein ek plate par sapaat rakhein.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000090_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_129", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ek paramparik puja ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bacein.\nB) Roshani karte samay unhein ek plate par sapaat rakhein."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Agar aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe, to aapko unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bachen. Isse agarbatti ki lakdi ko saman roop se jalne mein madad milegi aur vah tootne se bach jayegi. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Agar aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe, to aapko unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bachen. Isse agarbatti ki lakdi ko saman roop se jalne mein madad milegi aur vah tootne se bach jayegi. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Agar aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe, to aapko unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bachen. Isse agarbatti ki lakdi ko saman roop se jalne mein madad milegi aur vah tootne se bach jayegi. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Agar aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe, to aapko unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bachen. Isse agarbatti ki lakdi ko saman roop se jalne mein madad milegi aur vah tootne se bach jayegi. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Agar aap chahte hain ki agarbatti bina toote lagataar jalti rahe, to aapko unhein ek dharak mein seedha rakhein aur jalte samay unhein hilaane se bachen. Isse agarbatti ki lakdi ko saman roop se jalne mein madad milegi aur vah tootne se bach jayegi. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_59", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ। मैं अपनी बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखता हूँ\n\nA) ताकि बंदर अंदर न आ सकें।\nB) ताकि कुत्ते अंदर न आ सकें।", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0000_ex000037_hin_deva_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_59", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ। मैं अपनी बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखता हूँ\n\nA) ताकि बंदर अंदर न आ सकें।\nB) ताकि कुत्ते अंदर न आ सकें।"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ, इसलिए यहाँ कुत्तों के आने की संभावना कम है। बंदर ऊपरी मंजिलों पर आसानी से पहुँच सकते हैं और अक्सर शहरी क्षेत्रों में देखे जाते हैं। इसलिए, बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखने का मुख्य कारण बंदरों को अंदर आने से रोकना होगा।\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ, इसलिए यहाँ कुत्तों के आने की संभावना कम है। बंदर ऊपरी मंजिलों पर आसानी से पहुँच सकते हैं और अक्सर शहरी क्षेत्रों में देखे जाते हैं। इसलिए, बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखने का मुख्य कारण बंदरों को अंदर आने से रोकना होगा।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ, इसलिए यहाँ कुत्तों के आने की संभावना कम है। बंदर ऊपरी मंजिलों पर आसानी से पहुँच सकते हैं और अक्सर शहरी क्षेत्रों में देखे जाते हैं। इसलिए, बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखने का मुख्य कारण बंदरों को अंदर आने से रोकना होगा।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ, इसलिए यहाँ कुत्तों के आने की संभावना कम है। बंदर ऊपरी मंजिलों पर आसानी से पहुँच सकते हैं और अक्सर शहरी क्षेत्रों में देखे जाते हैं। इसलिए, बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखने का मुख्य कारण बंदरों को अंदर आने से रोकना होगा।\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "मैं अपनी बिल्डिंग की सबसे ऊपरी मंज़िल पर रहता हूँ, इसलिए यहाँ कुत्तों के आने की संभावना कम है। बंदर ऊपरी मंजिलों पर आसानी से पहुँच सकते हैं और अक्सर शहरी क्षेत्रों में देखे जाते हैं। इसलिए, बालकनी का दरवाज़ा बंद रखने का मुख्य कारण बंदरों को अंदर आने से रोकना होगा।\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_55", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar bhigona?\n\nA) Chipkaav ghate.\nB) Chipkaav aur bhaap se phulav.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000086_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_55", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar bhigona?\n\nA) Chipkaav ghate.\nB) Chipkaav aur bhaap se phulav."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar ko bhigna zaroori hai taaki naan chipak na jaye aur acchi tarah se pak sake. Is prakriya mein, deewar ko bhigna se us par chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav bhi hota hai, jisse naan acchi tarah se phoolta hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki deewar ko bhigna se chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar ko bhigna zaroori hai taaki naan chipak na jaye aur acchi tarah se pak sake. Is prakriya mein, deewar ko bhigna se us par chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav bhi hota hai, jisse naan acchi tarah se phoolta hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki deewar ko bhigna se chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar ko bhigna zaroori hai taaki naan chipak na jaye aur acchi tarah se pak sake. Is prakriya mein, deewar ko bhigna se us par chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav bhi hota hai, jisse naan acchi tarah se phoolta hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki deewar ko bhigna se chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar ko bhigna zaroori hai taaki naan chipak na jaye aur acchi tarah se pak sake. Is prakriya mein, deewar ko bhigna se us par chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav bhi hota hai, jisse naan acchi tarah se phoolta hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki deewar ko bhigna se chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Tandoor mein naan lagaane se pehle deewar ko bhigna zaroori hai taaki naan chipak na jaye aur acchi tarah se pak sake. Is prakriya mein, deewar ko bhigna se us par chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav bhi hota hai, jisse naan acchi tarah se phoolta hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki deewar ko bhigna se chipkaav ghata hai aur bhaap se phulav hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_23", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Masale kootne ke liye patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar kyon hai?\n\nA) Patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai.\nB) Steel ki chikni satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000071_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_23", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Masale kootne ke liye patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar kyon hai?\n\nA) Patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai.\nB) Steel ki chikni satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar hai kyunki patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai. Isse masale acchi tarah se pees jaate hain aur unka swad aur sugandh bhi barqarar rehta hai. Dusri aur, steel ki chikni satah par masale aasani se phisal jaate hain aur unhein peesne mein mushkil hoti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar hai kyunki patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai. Isse masale acchi tarah se pees jaate hain aur unka swad aur sugandh bhi barqarar rehta hai. Dusri aur, steel ki chikni satah par masale aasani se phisal jaate hain aur unhein peesne mein mushkil hoti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar hai kyunki patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai. Isse masale acchi tarah se pees jaate hain aur unka swad aur sugandh bhi barqarar rehta hai. Dusri aur, steel ki chikni satah par masale aasani se phisal jaate hain aur unhein peesne mein mushkil hoti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar hai kyunki patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai. Isse masale acchi tarah se pees jaate hain aur unka swad aur sugandh bhi barqarar rehta hai. Dusri aur, steel ki chikni satah par masale aasani se phisal jaate hain aur unhein peesne mein mushkil hoti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Patthar ka okhli-musal steel ki thaali se behtar hai kyunki patthar ki khurdari satah masalon ko pakadkar pees-ti hai. Isse masale acchi tarah se pees jaate hain aur unka swad aur sugandh bhi barqarar rehta hai. Dusri aur, steel ki chikni satah par masale aasani se phisal jaate hain aur unhein peesne mein mushkil hoti hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_7", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye\n\nA) Chhota kapada chahiye\nB) Lamba kapada chahiye", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000044_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_7", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye\n\nA) Chhota kapada chahiye\nB) Lamba kapada chahiye"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye lamba kapada chahiye hota hai, kyunki ismein kai gathein aur tanaav lagaye jaate hain. Chhota kapada is prakriya ke liye upyukt nahin hoga. Isliye, sahi vikalp lamba kapada chahiye hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye lamba kapada chahiye hota hai, kyunki ismein kai gathein aur tanaav lagaye jaate hain. Chhota kapada is prakriya ke liye upyukt nahin hoga. Isliye, sahi vikalp lamba kapada chahiye hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye lamba kapada chahiye hota hai, kyunki ismein kai gathein aur tanaav lagaye jaate hain. Chhota kapada is prakriya ke liye upyukt nahin hoga. Isliye, sahi vikalp lamba kapada chahiye hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye lamba kapada chahiye hota hai, kyunki ismein kai gathein aur tanaav lagaye jaate hain. Chhota kapada is prakriya ke liye upyukt nahin hoga. Isliye, sahi vikalp lamba kapada chahiye hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Rajasthani pagri baandhne ke liye lamba kapada chahiye hota hai, kyunki ismein kai gathein aur tanaav lagaye jaate hain. Chhota kapada is prakriya ke liye upyukt nahin hoga. Isliye, sahi vikalp lamba kapada chahiye hota hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_8", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Agar mitti ki haandi achanak tez aanch par rakh dein toh?\n\nA) Aur mazboot ho jaayegi kyonki pak jaayegi.\nB) Darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000094_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_8", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Agar mitti ki haandi achanak tez aanch par rakh dein toh?\n\nA) Aur mazboot ho jaayegi kyonki pak jaayegi.\nB) Darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Mitti ki haandi ko achanak tez aanch par rakhne se usmein taapiya jhatka padta hai, jisse usmein darar pad sakti hai. Yeh darar isliye padti hai kyonki mitti ki haandi ki saamagri achanak badle tejaapman ke kaaran apne aakaar mein badlav karti hai, jisse usmein tanav paida hota hai aur darar padne lagti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Mitti ki haandi ko achanak tez aanch par rakhne se usmein taapiya jhatka padta hai, jisse usmein darar pad sakti hai. Yeh darar isliye padti hai kyonki mitti ki haandi ki saamagri achanak badle tejaapman ke kaaran apne aakaar mein badlav karti hai, jisse usmein tanav paida hota hai aur darar padne lagti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi ko achanak tez aanch par rakhne se usmein taapiya jhatka padta hai, jisse usmein darar pad sakti hai. Yeh darar isliye padti hai kyonki mitti ki haandi ki saamagri achanak badle tejaapman ke kaaran apne aakaar mein badlav karti hai, jisse usmein tanav paida hota hai aur darar padne lagti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Mitti ki haandi ko achanak tez aanch par rakhne se usmein taapiya jhatka padta hai, jisse usmein darar pad sakti hai. Yeh darar isliye padti hai kyonki mitti ki haandi ki saamagri achanak badle tejaapman ke kaaran apne aakaar mein badlav karti hai, jisse usmein tanav paida hota hai aur darar padne lagti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi ko achanak tez aanch par rakhne se usmein taapiya jhatka padta hai, jisse usmein darar pad sakti hai. Yeh darar isliye padti hai kyonki mitti ki haandi ki saamagri achanak badle tejaapman ke kaaran apne aakaar mein badlav karti hai, jisse usmein tanav paida hota hai aur darar padne lagti hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki darar pad sakti hai kyonki taapiya jhatka.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_108", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki upahaar ko lapetna tab tak saaf-suthra rahe jab tak ki ise khola na jaaye. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Ise samay aane tak anya vastuon ke saath apne thaile mein rakhein.\nB) Ise saavdhani se lapetein aur ise surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhein.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000031_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_108", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki upahaar ko lapetna tab tak saaf-suthra rahe jab tak ki ise khola na jaaye. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Ise samay aane tak anya vastuon ke saath apne thaile mein rakhein.\nB) Ise saavdhani se lapetein aur ise surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhein."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan upahaar ko lapetna aur use saaf-suthra rakhna zaroori hai. Agar hum use anya vastuon ke saath thaile mein rakhein, to use nuksaan pahunchne ka khatra ho sakta hai. Isliye, humein use saavdhani se lapetna chahiye aur surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye. Isse upahaar saaf-suthra rahega aur ise khole jaane tak uska swaroop bhi banaya rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan upahaar ko lapetna aur use saaf-suthra rakhna zaroori hai. Agar hum use anya vastuon ke saath thaile mein rakhein, to use nuksaan pahunchne ka khatra ho sakta hai. Isliye, humein use saavdhani se lapetna chahiye aur surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye. Isse upahaar saaf-suthra rahega aur ise khole jaane tak uska swaroop bhi banaya rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan upahaar ko lapetna aur use saaf-suthra rakhna zaroori hai. Agar hum use anya vastuon ke saath thaile mein rakhein, to use nuksaan pahunchne ka khatra ho sakta hai. Isliye, humein use saavdhani se lapetna chahiye aur surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye. Isse upahaar saaf-suthra rahega aur ise khole jaane tak uska swaroop bhi banaya rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan upahaar ko lapetna aur use saaf-suthra rakhna zaroori hai. Agar hum use anya vastuon ke saath thaile mein rakhein, to use nuksaan pahunchne ka khatra ho sakta hai. Isliye, humein use saavdhani se lapetna chahiye aur surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye. Isse upahaar saaf-suthra rahega aur ise khole jaane tak uska swaroop bhi banaya rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Rakshabandhan ke dauraan upahaar ko lapetna aur use saaf-suthra rakhna zaroori hai. Agar hum use anya vastuon ke saath thaile mein rakhein, to use nuksaan pahunchne ka khatra ho sakta hai. Isliye, humein use saavdhani se lapetna chahiye aur surakshit, sookhi jagah par rakhna chahiye. Isse upahaar saaf-suthra rahega aur ise khole jaane tak uska swaroop bhi banaya rahega.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_151", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Diwali ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki aapke deeye raat bhar lambe samay tak jalein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Deeya ko adhik tel se bharein taaki yeh adhik samay tak jal sake.\nB) Deeya ke lambe samay tak chalne ke liye ek lambi baati ka upyog karein.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000014_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_151", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Diwali ke dauraan, aap chahte hain ki aapke deeye raat bhar lambe samay tak jalein. Aapko kya karna chahiye?\n\nA) Deeya ko adhik tel se bharein taaki yeh adhik samay tak jal sake.\nB) Deeya ke lambe samay tak chalne ke liye ek lambi baati ka upyog karein."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Diwali ke dauraan deeya ko lambe samay tak jalaye rakhne ke liye, humein deeya mein adhik tel bharna chahiye. Isse deeya mein agni adhik samay tak jal sakegi, kyunki tel ki matra adhik hone se agni ko jalne ke liye adhik samay milta hai. Isliye, deeya ko adhik tel se bharna sahi upay hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Diwali ke dauraan deeya ko lambe samay tak jalaye rakhne ke liye, humein deeya mein adhik tel bharna chahiye. Isse deeya mein agni adhik samay tak jal sakegi, kyunki tel ki matra adhik hone se agni ko jalne ke liye adhik samay milta hai. Isliye, deeya ko adhik tel se bharna sahi upay hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Diwali ke dauraan deeya ko lambe samay tak jalaye rakhne ke liye, humein deeya mein adhik tel bharna chahiye. Isse deeya mein agni adhik samay tak jal sakegi, kyunki tel ki matra adhik hone se agni ko jalne ke liye adhik samay milta hai. Isliye, deeya ko adhik tel se bharna sahi upay hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Diwali ke dauraan deeya ko lambe samay tak jalaye rakhne ke liye, humein deeya mein adhik tel bharna chahiye. Isse deeya mein agni adhik samay tak jal sakegi, kyunki tel ki matra adhik hone se agni ko jalne ke liye adhik samay milta hai. Isliye, deeya ko adhik tel se bharna sahi upay hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Diwali ke dauraan deeya ko lambe samay tak jalaye rakhne ke liye, humein deeya mein adhik tel bharna chahiye. Isse deeya mein agni adhik samay tak jal sakegi, kyunki tel ki matra adhik hone se agni ko jalne ke liye adhik samay milta hai. Isliye, deeya ko adhik tel se bharna sahi upay hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_22", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Agar mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaayi jaaye toh kya asar hoga?\n\nA) Dheere-dheere khana pakega aur swaad achha hoga.\nB) Khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga.", "answer": "A", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000012_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_22", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Agar mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaayi jaaye toh kya asar hoga?\n\nA) Dheere-dheere khana pakega aur swaad achha hoga.\nB) Khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Aag par chadhaayi gayi mitti ki haandi mein khana pakane se mitti ka swaad aur aag ka garmi ka asar milta hai, jo khane ko dheere-dheere pakata hai aur swaad achha banaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}], "distill": {"gold": "A", "predicted": "A", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "swiss-ai/Apertus-70B-Instruct-2509", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Aag par chadhaayi gayi mitti ki haandi mein khana pakane se mitti ka swaad aur aag ka garmi ka asar milta hai, jo khane ko dheere-dheere pakata hai aur swaad achha banaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Aag par chadhaayi gayi mitti ki haandi mein khana pakane se mitti ka swaad aur aag ka garmi ka asar milta hai, jo khane ko dheere-dheere pakata hai aur swaad achha banaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana halka hai aur aag ka taapmaan bahut adhik hai, toh khana turant jal sakta hai aur uska swaad kharaab ho sakta hai. Isliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana halka hai aur aag ka taapmaan bahut adhik hai, toh khana turant jal sakta hai aur uska swaad kharaab ho sakta hai. Isliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 2, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se haandi ke taapmaan mein tezi se vriddhi hogi. Isse haandi mein rakha khana turant garam ho jaayega aur yadi samay par dhyaan na diya jaaye toh jalne ki sambhavna bhi badh jaati hai. Isliye, khana turant jal sakta hai aur swaad bhi kharaab ho sakta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se haandi ke taapmaan mein tezi se vriddhi hogi. Isse haandi mein rakha khana turant garam ho jaayega aur yadi samay par dhyaan na diya jaaye toh jalne ki sambhavna bhi badh jaati hai. Isliye, khana turant jal sakta hai aur swaad bhi kharaab ho sakta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 3, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana halka hai ya uski maatra kam hai, toh yeh sambhav hai ki khana turant jal jaaye, kyunki mitti ki haandi mein garami tezi se failti hai. Isse khane ka swaad bhi kharaab ho sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana halka hai ya uski maatra kam hai, toh yeh sambhav hai ki khana turant jal jaaye, kyunki mitti ki haandi mein garami tezi se failti hai. Isse khane ka swaad bhi kharaab ho sakta hai. \n\nIsliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal jaayega aur swaad kharaab hoga.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 4, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "B", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:B", "raw": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana achhi tarah se nahi dhakha hai ya aag ka taapmaan bahut adhik hai, toh khana jalne ki sambhavana badh jaati hai. Isliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal sakta hai aur uska swaad kharaab ho sakta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se uska taapmaan badhega, jisse usmein rakha khana turant pakne lagta hai. Agar haandi mein khana achhi tarah se nahi dhakha hai ya aag ka taapmaan bahut adhik hai, toh khana jalne ki sambhavana badh jaati hai. Isliye, mitti ki haandi aag par chadhaane se khana turant jal sakta hai aur uska swaad kharaab ho sakta hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "swiss-ai/Apertus-70B-Instruct-2509", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Aag par chadhaayi gayi mitti ki haandi mein khana pakane se mitti ka swaad aur aag ka garmi ka asar milta hai, jo khane ko dheere-dheere pakata hai aur swaad achha banaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Aag par chadhaayi gayi mitti ki haandi mein khana pakane se mitti ka swaad aur aag ka garmi ka asar milta hai, jo khane ko dheere-dheere pakata hai aur swaad achha banaata hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_139", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद?\n\nA) ध्वनि तीखी/ऊँची।\nB) ध्वनि मंद/गहरी हो सकती।", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0094_ex000982_hin_deva_7_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_139", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद?\n\nA) ध्वनि तीखी/ऊँची।\nB) ध्वनि मंद/गहरी हो सकती।"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से चमड़ी की सतह पर एक पतली परत बन जाती है, जो ध्वनि के उत्पादन को प्रभावित करती है। यह परत चमड़ी की कंपन को कम कर देती है, जिससे उत्पन्न ध्वनि मंद या गहरी हो जाती है। इसलिए, ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से ध्वनि मंद/गहरी हो सकती है।\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से चमड़ी की सतह पर एक पतली परत बन जाती है, जो ध्वनि के उत्पादन को प्रभावित करती है। यह परत चमड़ी की कंपन को कम कर देती है, जिससे उत्पन्न ध्वनि मंद या गहरी हो जाती है। इसलिए, ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से ध्वनि मंद/गहरी हो सकती है।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से चमड़ी की सतह पर एक पतली परत बन जाती है, जो ध्वनि के उत्पादन को प्रभावित करती है। यह परत चमड़ी की कंपन को कम कर देती है, जिससे उत्पन्न ध्वनि मंद या गहरी हो जाती है। इसलिए, ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से ध्वनि मंद/गहरी हो सकती है।\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "ढोलक की चमड़ी पर तेल की बूँद डालने से चमड़ी की सतह पर एक पतली परत बन जाती है, जो ध्वनि के उत्पादन को प्रभावित करती है। यह परत चमड़ी की