{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_62", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Raita banaane ke liye\n\nA) Aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaakar pakaana chahiye.\nB) Aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lene chahiye.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000029_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_62", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Raita banaane ke liye\n\nA) Aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaakar pakaana chahiye.\nB) Aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lene chahiye."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Raita banaane ke liye, aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaana hota hai, lekin inhein pakaane ki aavashyakta nahin hoti. Raita ek aisa vyanjan hai jismein dahi ko thanda rakha jaata hai aur ismein sabziyan aur masale milaaye jaate hain. Isliye, raita banaane ke liye aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lena chahiye. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Raita banaane ke liye, aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaana hota hai, lekin inhein pakaane ki aavashyakta nahin hoti. Raita ek aisa vyanjan hai jismein dahi ko thanda rakha jaata hai aur ismein sabziyan aur masale milaaye jaate hain. Isliye, raita banaane ke liye aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lena chahiye. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Raita banaane ke liye, aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaana hota hai, lekin inhein pakaane ki aavashyakta nahin hoti. Raita ek aisa vyanjan hai jismein dahi ko thanda rakha jaata hai aur ismein sabziyan aur masale milaaye jaate hain. Isliye, raita banaane ke liye aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lena chahiye. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Raita banaane ke liye, aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaana hota hai, lekin inhein pakaane ki aavashyakta nahin hoti. Raita ek aisa vyanjan hai jismein dahi ko thanda rakha jaata hai aur ismein sabziyan aur masale milaaye jaate hain. Isliye, raita banaane ke liye aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lena chahiye. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Raita banaane ke liye, aapko dahi, sabziyan aur masale milaana hota hai, lekin inhein pakaane ki aavashyakta nahin hoti. Raita ek aisa vyanjan hai jismein dahi ko thanda rakha jaata hai aur ismein sabziyan aur masale milaaye jaate hain. Isliye, raita banaane ke liye aapko ek katori mein dahi, sabziyan aur masale mila lena chahiye. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_70", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Ghaday ka munh sankara kyon?\n\nA) Vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam.\nB) Vaashpeekaran niyantrit, thandak tike.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000055_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_70", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Ghaday ka munh sankara kyon?\n\nA) Vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam.\nB) Vaashpeekaran niyantrit, thandak tike."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran niyantrit rehta hai aur thandak tike rehti hai. Jab vaashpeekaran niyantrit hota hai, to ghaday ke andar ki garmi bahar nahin nikalti, jisse thandak tike rehti hai aur munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, vikalp B sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "gold_fallback", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran niyantrit rehta hai aur thandak tike rehti hai. Jab vaashpeekaran niyantrit hota hai, to ghaday ke andar ki garmi bahar nahin nikalti, jisse thandak tike rehti hai aur munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, vikalp B sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran niyantrit rehta hai aur thandak tike rehti hai. Jab vaashpeekaran niyantrit hota hai, to ghaday ke andar ki garmi bahar nahin nikalti, jisse thandak tike rehti hai aur munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, vikalp B sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:A", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ke munh par sankara ban jata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo vaashpeekaran badhne aur paani garam hone ka ullekh karta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ke munh par sankara ban jata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo vaashpeekaran badhne aur paani garam hone ka ullekh karta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 2, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "A", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:A", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara is ek aam ghatna hai jo tab hoti hai jab vaashpeekaran badhta hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ka munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara is ek aam ghatna hai jo tab hoti hai jab vaashpeekaran badhta hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ka munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yah hai ki vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 3, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "A", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:A", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara iska mukhya kaaran yeh hai ki jab vaashpeekaran badhta hai, to paani garam hota hai aur vapour mein badalne lagta hai. Is prakriya mein, ghaday ke andar ki thandak kam ho jaati hai aur ghaday ka munh sankara ho jaata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara iska mukhya kaaran yeh hai ki jab vaashpeekaran badhta hai, to paani garam hota hai aur vapour mein badalne lagta hai. Is prakriya mein, ghaday ke andar ki thandak kam ho jaati hai aur ghaday ka munh sankara ho jaata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar yeh hai ki vaashpeekaran badhe, paani garam.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 4, "temperature": 0.35, "predicted": "A", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:A", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ke munh par sankara ban jata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo vaashpeekaran badhne aur paani garam hone ka ullekh karta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. Jab paani garam hota hai, to vaashpeekaran ki dar badh jati hai, jisse ghaday ke munh par sankara ban jata hai. Isliye, sahi uttar vah hai jo vaashpeekaran badhne aur paani garam hone ka ullekh karta hai.\n\n\\boxed{A}"}, {"stage": "independent", "model": "swiss-ai/Apertus-70B-Instruct-2509", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "A", "valid": false, "invalid_reason": "wrong_answer:A", "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara hota hai kyunki usme vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara hota hai kyunki usme vaashpeekaran badhta hai aur paani garam hota hai. \n\n\\boxed{A}"}, {"stage": "gold_fallback", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran niyantrit rehta hai aur thandak tike rehti hai. Jab vaashpeekaran niyantrit hota hai, to ghaday ke andar ki garmi bahar nahin nikalti, jisse thandak tike rehti hai aur munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, vikalp B sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Ghaday ka munh sankara isliye hota hai kyonki vaashpeekaran niyantrit rehta hai aur thandak tike rehti hai. Jab vaashpeekaran niyantrit hota hai, to ghaday ke andar ki garmi bahar nahin nikalti, jisse thandak tike rehti hai aur munh sankara hota hai. Isliye, vikalp B sahi hai.\n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_189", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "लोटे से जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर क्यों टूटती?\n\nA) ठोस रेखा—तनाव नहीं।\nB) बूंदों में—सतह तनाव/अपवर्तन।", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_deva", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0094_ex001023_hin_deva_7_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_189", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "लोटे से जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर क्यों टूटती?\n\nA) ठोस रेखा—तनाव नहीं।\nB) बूंदों में—सतह तनाव/अपवर्तन।"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "लोटे से जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर टूटती है क्योंकि जल की सतह तनाव और अपवर्तन के कारण बूंदों में विभाजित हो जाती है। जब जलधारा ऊँचाई से गिरती है, तो इसकी गति और तनाव बढ़ जाते हैं, जिससे यह पतली और कमजोर हो जाती है। इस स्थिति में, सतह तनाव के कारण जलधारा बूंदों में टूट जाती है। \n\nइसलिए, सही उत्तर यह है कि जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर बूंदों में—सतह तनाव/अपवर्तन के कारण टूटती है। \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "लोटे से जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर टूटती है क्योंकि जल की सतह तनाव और अपवर्तन के कारण बूंदों में विभाजित हो जाती है। जब जलधारा ऊँचाई से गिरती है, तो इसकी गति और तनाव बढ़ जाते हैं, जिससे यह पतली और कमजोर हो जाती है। इस स्थिति में, सतह तनाव के कारण जलधारा बूंदों में टूट जाती है। \n\nइसलिए, सही उत्तर यह है कि जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर बूंदों में—सतह तनाव/अपवर्तन के कारण टूटती है। \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "लोटे से जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर टूटती है क्योंकि जल की सतह तनाव और अपवर्तन के कारण बूंदों में विभाजित हो जाती है। जब जलधारा ऊँचाई से गिरती है, तो इसकी गति और तनाव बढ़ जाते हैं, जिससे यह पतली और कमजोर हो जाती है। इस स्थिति में, सतह तनाव के कारण जलधारा बूंदों में टूट जाती है। \n\nइसलिए, सही उत्तर यह है कि जलधारा पतली ऊँचाई पर बूंदों में—सतह तनाव/अपवर्तन के कारण टूटती है। \n\n\\