{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_28", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par kyon toot-ti?\n\nA) Thos rekha--tanaav nahin.\nB) Boondon mein--satah tanaav/apavartan.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000059_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_28", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par kyon toot-ti?\n\nA) Thos rekha--tanaav nahin.\nB) Boondon mein--satah tanaav/apavartan."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai kyonki usmein boondon mein satah tanaav/apavartan ka prabhav hota hai. Jab paani ki boondein oonchaai par pahunchti hain, to unka satah kshetrafal kam ho jaata hai, jisse unka satah tanaav badh jaata hai. Is wajah se, boondein toot-ti hain aur jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai kyonki usmein boondon mein satah tanaav/apavartan ka prabhav hota hai. Jab paani ki boondein oonchaai par pahunchti hain, to unka satah kshetrafal kam ho jaata hai, jisse unka satah tanaav badh jaata hai. Is wajah se, boondein toot-ti hain aur jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai kyonki usmein boondon mein satah tanaav/apavartan ka prabhav hota hai. Jab paani ki boondein oonchaai par pahunchti hain, to unka satah kshetrafal kam ho jaata hai, jisse unka satah tanaav badh jaata hai. Is wajah se, boondein toot-ti hain aur jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai kyonki usmein boondon mein satah tanaav/apavartan ka prabhav hota hai. Jab paani ki boondein oonchaai par pahunchti hain, to unka satah kshetrafal kam ho jaata hai, jisse unka satah tanaav badh jaata hai. Is wajah se, boondein toot-ti hain aur jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Lote se jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai kyonki usmein boondon mein satah tanaav/apavartan ka prabhav hota hai. Jab paani ki boondein oonchaai par pahunchti hain, to unka satah kshetrafal kam ho jaata hai, jisse unka satah tanaav badh jaata hai. Is wajah se, boondein toot-ti hain aur jaldhara patli oonchaai par toot-ti hai. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
{"id": "global_piqa_hindi_163", "dataset": "global_piqa", "language": "hindi", "task_type": "mcq", "prompt": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi kyon naram hote?\n\nA) Mote aur kachche rehte hain.\nB) Pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle hain.", "answer": "B", "metadata": {"config": "hin_latn", "approx_cultural_score": 1, "example_id": "group0148_ex000022_hin_latn_0_v1", "source_split": "test"}, "source_id": "global_piqa_hindi_163", "split": "train", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": ""}, {"role": "user", "content": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi kyon naram hote?\n\nA) Mote aur kachche rehte hain.\nB) Pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle hain."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi naram hote hain kyonki ve pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle kiye jaate hain. Is prakriya mein, chawal ko bhaap dein se pakaya jaata hai, jisse unka starch nikal jaata hai aur ve patle ho jaate hain. Iska parinaam yeh hota hai ki ve jaldi se pani absorb kar lete hain aur naram ho jaate hain. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}], "distill": {"gold": "B", "predicted": "B", "correct": true, "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "used_teacher": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "mode": "independent", "raw": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi naram hote hain kyonki ve pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle kiye jaate hain. Is prakriya mein, chawal ko bhaap dein se pakaya jaata hai, jisse unka starch nikal jaata hai aur ve patle ho jaate hain. Iska parinaam yeh hota hai ki ve jaldi se pani absorb kar lete hain aur naram ho jaate hain. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "think_content": "", "clean": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi naram hote hain kyonki ve pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle kiye jaate hain. Is prakriya mein, chawal ko bhaap dein se pakaya jaata hai, jisse unka starch nikal jaata hai aur ve patle ho jaate hain. Iska parinaam yeh hota hai ki ve jaldi se pani absorb kar lete hain aur naram ho jaate hain. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "attempts": [{"stage": "independent", "model": "meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "temperature": 0.0, "predicted": "B", "valid": true, "invalid_reason": null, "raw": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi naram hote hain kyonki ve pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle kiye jaate hain. Is prakriya mein, chawal ko bhaap dein se pakaya jaata hai, jisse unka starch nikal jaata hai aur ve patle ho jaate hain. Iska parinaam yeh hota hai ki ve jaldi se pani absorb kar lete hain aur naram ho jaate hain. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "clean": "Koote chawal (Poha) jaldi naram hote hain kyonki ve pehle se bhaap mein pakkar patle kiye jaate hain. Is prakriya mein, chawal ko bhaap dein se pakaya jaata hai, jisse unka starch nikal jaata hai aur ve patle ho jaate hain. Iska parinaam yeh hota hai ki ve jaldi se pani absorb kar lete hain aur naram ho jaate hain. \n\n\\boxed{B}"}]}}
